# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/debug
/target

# Spec vectors are cached OUTSIDE the tree, at
# ${SPEC_VECTORS_CACHE:-$HOME/.cache/eth-consensus-spec-vectors} — never under target/.
#
# Hoodi fixtures (CC-10b): SSZ lives under
# ${HOODI_FIXTURES_CACHE:-$HOME/.cache/cc-hoodi-fixtures} — never under the repo.
# Defense-in-depth: never commit SSZ blobs if they land in the worktree by mistake.
*.ssz
# Exception: CC-22e hostile-input seed corpus (small Default containers + sample capture).
!services/p2p/tests/fixtures/corpus/**/*.ssz

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# Local secrets (A7 / A-P0-5). .dockerignore already keeps these out of images;
# this keeps them out of the repository. The Engine API JWT lives here (CC-39/3, ≠13/6).
# secrets/* (not secrets/) so secrets/.gitkeep can be tracked as a path placeholder.
secrets/*
!secrets/.gitkeep
**/jwt.hex

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/
